---
// NegocioDuerme.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-plai-black relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-16" data-animate>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
                <span class="italic">¿Tu negocio duerme?</span><br />
                Tus clientes no.
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16" data-animate data-animate-stagger>
            <!-- La Carga Operativa -->
            <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-plai-accent/30 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 text-plai-accent">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full">
                        <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                        <path d="M32 16v18l12 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-plai-accent mb-4">La Carga Operativa</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 font-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
                    Responder preguntas repetitivas consume horas valiosas que tu equipo debería dedicar a estrategia, no a soporte.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- El Costo del Silencio -->
            <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-plai-accent/30 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 text-plai-accent">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full">
                        <rect x="16" y="8" rx="4" width="32" height="48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                        <path d="M28 46h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <path d="M26 24c0-2 2-4 6-4s6 2 6 4-2 3-4 4c-1 .5-2 1.5-2 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <circle cx="32" cy="36" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-plai-accent mb-4">El Costo del Silencio</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 font-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
                    Un mensaje no respondido en los primeros 5 minutos reduce drásticamente la probabilidad de cierre. El cliente moderno no espera.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Fugas en el Funnel -->
            <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-plai-accent/30 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 text-plai-accent">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full">
                        <path d="M12 12h40L38 36v14l-12 4V36L12 12z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <path d="M42 28c2 2 4 2 6 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <circle cx="48" cy="32" r="2" fill="currentColor"/>
                        <circle cx="44" cy="38" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-plai-accent mb-4">Fugas en el Funnel</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 font-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
                    Carritos abandonados, dudas nocturnas y citas no confirmadas son ingresos que estás dejando sobre la mesa.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom CTA banner -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-animate>
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-plai-primary/20 via-plai-cyan/10 to-plai-primary/20 border border-plai-cyan/20 rounded-2xl px-8 py-6 text-center">
                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-body text-white leading-relaxed">
                    Necesitas <span class="text-plai-cyan font-bold">escalar tu capacidad de atención</span> sin sacrificar la <span class="italic text-white/90">calidad humana</span>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
